  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Inclusive &amp; Resilient Enterprises (BIRE) - Building Inclusive and Resilient Enterprises (BIRE)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bygga inkluderande och livskraftiga f&#xf6;retag (BIRE)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna st&#xf6;det &#xe4;r till att HiH EA ska implementera ett program &quot;Utveckling av inkluderande och motst&#xe5;ndskraftiga f&#xf6;retag&quot; (DIRE) som best&#xe5;r av tv&#xe5; projekt f&#xf6;rankrade i tv&#xe5; m&#xf6;jlighetsomr&#xe5;den: 1. MSME; 2. Waste to Resource (W2R &#x2013; avfallshantering och cirkularitet). HiH EA f&#xf6;resl&#xe5;r att man ska anv&#xe4;nda sin fyrastegsmodell (med sju inbyggda modul&#xe4;ra utbildningsmetoder) i utvecklingen av f&#xf6;retag inom de tv&#xe5; m&#xf6;jlighetsomr&#xe5;dena. HiH EA str&#xe4;var efter att arbeta med Bottom of the Pyramid (BoP) f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rmedla ekonomisk f&#xf6;rvaltning/l&#xe4;skunnighet, inspirera f&#xf6;retags inneboende uppfattning, f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra ekonomisk tillg&#xe5;ng samt st&#xf6;dja f&#xf6;retag att knyta an till bredare marknader. Implementeringsstrategin och tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;ttet har kompletterande kapacitetsbyggande tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;r att integrera f&#xf6;retagsresiliens, skapa kapacitet f&#xf6;r entrepren&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r byr&#xe5;krati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter, j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsintegrering och spridning av planetv&#xe4;nliga metoder i f&#xf6;retagsutveckling.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed support is for HiH EA to implement a programme &#x201c;Development of Inclusive and Resilient Enterprises&#x201d; (DIRE) composed of two projects anchored on two opportunity areas of: 1. MSMEs; 2. Waste to Resource (W2R &#x2013; waste management and circularity). HiH EA proposes to deploy its four step model (with seven in-built modular training approach) in development of enterprises in the two opportunity areas. HiH EA aims to work with the Bottom of the Pyramid (BoP) to impart financial management/literacy, inspire intrinsic conception of enterprises, enhance financial access as well as support enterprises to make linkage to broader markets. The implementation strategy and approach has complementary capacity building approach to integrate enterprise resilience, create capacity for agency in entrepreneurs for policy advocacy and human rights, gender mainstreaming, and deployment of planet friendly practices in enterprise development.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Goal Level: To contribute to the well being of the project direct participant through reduction of poverty and exclusion among willing people in both rural, urban, and peri- urban areas.

Purpose Level: To develop viable enterprises that will contribute to move direct project participants in rural, urban and peri-urban areas of 14 counties in Kenya from poverty to middle income status as envisaged in Kenyas Vision 2030.

Project key Outcomes

Outcome 1: Knowledge and skills on enterprise development among beneficiaries enhanced

Outcome 2: Appropriate market chains developed

Outcome 3: Resilience of enterprise development enhanced

Outcome 4: Organizational capacity for implementation and M&amp;E is enhanced</narrative>
  </description>
